 "text": {
  "heroLead": "I try to find a story behind every frame — because every frame is unique.",
  "aboutBody": "I'm Prasant Shil Sarma — a photographer who is still learning, because I believe learning never stops in photography. I chase stories on the street, in faces, in faded vintage tones, in quiet nature and under loud concert lights. Every frame is unique, and every frame holds a story."
